    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687-a6">

                <pb facs="1198" n="1104" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg1104"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Earl of Clarendon to
                        Lord Stratford de Redcliffe.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1853-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 4,
                        1853</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have to acquaint your excellency that Her Majesty’s Government have received
                    with satisfaction the firman issued by the Sultan in behalf of his Protestant
                    subjects, inclosed in your dispatch of the 8th instant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clarendon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
